1	// The part of the design-token application that every JusPrin web surface
2	// needs: resources/jusprin/ui/design-tokens.json becomes CSS custom
3	// properties, so a stylesheet can use var(--...) instead of a literal color,
4	// radius, or type metric. Each page adds its own component variables on top
5	// (the Agent page's thread row, Home's cards) and composes the variable-name
6	// list its own styles test checks against.
